<title>HONG KONG: HK Sept provisional trade deficit HK$4.6 bln.</title>
<headline>HK Sept provisional trade deficit HK$4.6 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department released the following data showing a provisional visible trade deficit of HK$4.6 billion in September (rounded figures in billions of H.K. dollars):</p>
<p>			   Sept '96     Aug '96	 Sept '95</p>
<p> Trade balance	  -4.6	   -7.21	   -4.33</p>
<p> Domestic Exports     18.3	   18.18	   21.12</p>
<p> Re-exports	    107.8	  106.68	  105.50</p>
<p> Total exports	 126.1	  124.87	  126.63</p>
<p> Imports		 130.7	  132.07	  130.95</p>
<p>Cumulative figures for year-ended -</p>
<p>			   Sept '96     Aug '96	 Sept '95</p>
<p> Trade balance	 -135.11	 -134.83	  -136.79</p>
<p> Domestic Exports     216.29	  219.14	   233.79</p>
<p> Re-exports	   1,167.55	1,165.22	 1,081.52</p>
<p> Total exports	1,383.84	1,384.36	 1,315.31</p>
<p> Imports		1,518.95	1,519.19	 1,452.10</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
